                <divLine xml:id="m-9cf814c5-55eb-400f-80cc-993ba8ef93bf" facs="#m-a0eff9c8-4aef-49fb-bc92-f7339ff4b2d7" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-9a558cf8-4704-4afd-8f45-a998ee68dd9c">
              <lg xml:id="m-bd5ee5a3-bda2-466b-bc06-844985112140">
                <l xml:id="m-66aa16bd-83fa-478b-8092-e26581338f2e" facs="#m-b232b75c-60da-4ce2-bbd2-4ece584fbe90" label="text-like">At Mass</l><l xml:id="m-a496cbd3-bee7-42a8-8f8c-13060bfeffbb" facs="#m-089856a4-8042-4145-9b05-b17af4b7f686" label="ambiguous">781</l><l xml:id="m-a4be6e4d-39aa-4ffd-b4b1-8f2d0e23589f" facs="#m-c69ba71e-b9bb-4f50-8db1-2da4dde02fae" label="ambiguous">* Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Marcum. Marc. 16.</l><l xml:id="m-f73c0ca9-05cf-415e-b332-f847d9520a6d" facs="#m-cdd5a924-6304-4cbc-9907-45b9a6f76f69" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: María Magda- dérunt júvenem sedéntem in dex¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1c2ab8b-e4c7-4e31-98a9-dce5dcf448a6" facs="#m-8792c99b-5ee7-4811-b08e-e0655f382905" label="lyrics-like">L léne, et Maria Jacóbi, et Saló¬</l><l xml:id="m-adc12cc1-6d2f-44bc-aaf6-f7e59dc0e970" facs="#m-1e3ad36e-2a3c-44a1-aa4e-50bdb5d4a98f" label="lyrics-like">tris, coopértum stola cándida, et</l><l xml:id="m-02f43fc9-b150-4362-8470-a0a4c5b2112a" facs="#m-2ddcef93-e1e4-4dd3-98d3-6f2e12c6d3b0" label="lyrics-like">obstupuérunt. Qui dicit illis : Nolite</l><l xml:id="m-a395e9c8-43a7-4de0-84ba-ae8955c11020" facs="#m-7d144071-d83d-47d6-92e5-aa121b2e50ed" label="lyrics-like">me emérunt arómata, ut veniéntes</l><l xml:id="m-ced36f89-9d21-47db-8977-3956bc7672ac" facs="#m-2263dc82-a16c-4cc8-991c-bdc7cbae8ae0" label="lyrics-like">expavéscere: Jesum quaéritis Na¬</l><l xml:id="m-f40e8df2-5283-464a-9aeb-15d5443117d9" facs="#m-07348214-5c23-4270-92e1-5869be4f0638" label="lyrics-like">úngerent Jesum. Et valde mane</l><l xml:id="m-a512bb0a-aecc-4529-82e5-540c3492592a" facs="#m-0e09018d-fab4-4a7e-adb3-1416ff3c2c80" label="lyrics-like">unã sabbatórum, véniunt ad monu¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f2f1d4b-8a0b-4480-a805-16fba9a07097" facs="#m-2f041bf9-1ba6-4f17-b657-8f0d64db7105" label="lyrics-like">zarénum, crucifixum: surréxit, non</l><l xml:id="m-434443b6-8d83-42f2-be17-41867b0dd030" facs="#m-b02997af-2591-4118-90f3-3d98b835de68" label="lyrics-like">méntum, orto jam sole. Et dicébant</l><l xml:id="m-c4446d73-30e9-43c5-bc3b-3f0c4ad854d9" facs="#m-2221c4e5-238d-458d-a28e-67f905adb21d" label="lyrics-like">est hic, ecce locus ubi posuérunt</l><l xml:id="m-b333bed3-185e-4f5b-9fd2-0562dee6fba3" facs="#m-2c256cc8-6d41-4a2d-8b7a-5a3f4cf183a3" label="lyrics-like">ad invicem: Quis revólvet nobis</l><l xml:id="m-3a871700-66de-4da1-b630-5518c2121fdc" facs="#m-89836d88-2a6e-478e-bd5f-40ad1cd1616e" label="ambiguous">eum. Sed ite, dicite discipulis ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-c0feacb0-2338-4db7-b8a0-67005f74b94d" facs="#m-36f6afdc-2a9c-4b2f-af03-8280866ab823" label="lyrics-like">lápidem ab óstio monuménti? Et</l><l xml:id="m-e34228f9-cad9-46b7-aa03-d1c1a895d276" facs="#m-629a4d36-150d-4bfd-98b8-d9a2e138f44a" label="lyrics-like">et Petro, quia praecédit vos in</l><l xml:id="m-db4f2dd9-c863-4304-a56e-7d29ffbedc6b" facs="#m-6e35aa40-7f2b-42b6-a796-90272b5972d5" label="lyrics-like">respiciéntes vidérunt revolútum lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1b2a749-fab7-40fc-a507-38068a12d8ef" facs="#m-2118cf2c-202a-43c6-8923-a016733042a7" label="lyrics-like">Galilaéam : ibi eum vidébitis, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-54f46449-b410-46b9-911b-c3513405d78d" facs="#m-ce56931a-1501-4a19-bcb6-b6c756e3f3f8" label="ambiguous">pidem. Erat quippe magnus valde.] dixit vobis.</l><l xml:id="m-094de47b-5c31-4238-b61c-337cd48250fb" facs="#m-f43517c4-f22c-40b8-902d-1ae73ad2d86c" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-c0bbd56b-de16-43fa-b6d9-68815be55d72" facs="#m-e6ec5168-8484-4b1f-ae3f-d86155b77397" label="lyrics-like">Et introeuntes in monuméntum vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-0759cc58-3e4c-474e-93fe-ea47ecf62046" facs="#m-a3d4e564-fba3-49f6-a9d7-5b20c2fb6128" label="ambiguous">orert.E</l><l xml:id="m-ad250320-66b7-4c21-b22b-0aaba2c8b14f" facs="#m-60b77418-1785-49b8-9cf4-5dc24ac7b7a0" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-e06e40fa-406f-4112-9f59-22fa177d4ae3" facs="#m-14e875a6-5ff9-4e55-b7bf-46198ecd998e" label="lyrics-like">trému- it, et qui- é- vit,</l><l xml:id="m-9b2a8f5b-dc58-42b7-af23-bcad7d818625" facs="#m-d7b73bb7-7b1d-4e97-b44b-707692233999" label="ambiguous">Erra</l><l xml:id="m-878b8cca-84d3-4578-87d7-9dbf895c9bf7" facs="#m-df4b8b7e-b70a-4d27-a0c0-234aa50167e3" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-3879be68-d771-4d5f-92d7-f422abe8726b" facs="#m-a99eaadc-f2c0-4299-8aeb-9b74e8a9f45c" label="lyrics-like">dum resúrge-ret</l><l xml:id="m-4e2d52d2-d128-4757-831a-fe90e16c9c35" facs="#m-213b0224-ae2d-4599-bb2d-47b628841e04" label="lyrics-like">in judí¬ ci-o Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e278253-8005-4832-b9dc-b435cb06434a" facs="#m-b9271ef4-eb01-4d0e-a08f-38d76b9ae098" label="ambiguous">us,</l><l xml:id="m-8d9252f1-2479-4ee1-a9e6-f17db11812b0" facs="#m-4fc335b9-b581-4e27-a5e4-63b2da671b7a" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-f6f1e70a-1d8f-4a8a-b3dd-e5cab21e0f9f" facs="#m-431e507f-d321-47c6-9147-275bebf5285c" label="ambiguous">al¬</l><l xml:id="m-407825c2-2d19-4760-875c-b1a0db6abc49" facs="#m-1b415158-7727-4462-ac4b-752a777a9c22" label="ambiguous">le¬</l><l xml:id="m-b464bbb6-ab1a-4327-bc05-b23d4aba082c" facs="#m-34a47f00-475c-4317-ba4b-de3bae4e6b05" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-69b6e9d1-f395-41e5-a6c8-5f686eeb0ca9" facs="#m-18ae2d42-3150-46bc-b1bc-df32c64f368c" label="lyrics-like">YUscipe, quaésumus Dómine, pre-! mystériis, ad aeternitátis nobis me¬</l><l xml:id="m-286f51af-9778-4154-a86e-bba029f00787" facs="#m-30e24a6b-251e-4727-a5a7-eccbfe9bc5ef" label="lyrics-like">délam, te operánte, proficiant. Per</l><l xml:id="m-3fd72491-a37f-4a51-ba2b-f5c17a05b0dc" facs="#m-fa116399-5f95-4028-9708-83f546e636fd" label="lyrics-like">O ces pópuli tui cum oblatiónibus</l><l xml:id="m-04f7ac34-75a1-40f9-b6da-89d0935c005f" facs="#m-3f7e748d-2f19-4c10-97f7-51100c58fc66" label="lyrics-like">hostiárum : ut paschálibus initiáta! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-6d84ab25-9fbb-4edb-847e-3a1a5f812061" facs="#m-b2001f47-9196-4509-a60a-7b29a5e74435" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-69538466-31dc-435b-81d6-f343f86628a6" facs="#m-c7ed8e9b-3f89-4d47-a629-9c984f7ab64e" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-5578f0b0-142e-4e4f-b31b-6bc3ddfc54e3" facs="#m-831bda50-f8d3-45cf-a752-0c52f5f1f823" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-875e7478-a953-4ef0-b26c-feaeb1ab7584" facs="#m-24cbce0a-0298-4097-8966-fb6fa3c2593a" label="lyrics-like">immo-látus</l><l xml:id="m-8d827fe6-b1d8-4c9b-8c28-a715991896e9" facs="#m-2555549b-626c-4732-a562-f6f2389cf265" label="lyrics-like">est Chrí¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ca7bf03-f373-4094-b71b-2c60592ff025" facs="#m-ff9c885c-fa07-4d52-ad40-7ede9c1a267f" label="lyrics-like">Ascha nóstrum</l><l xml:id="m-0a2ca90a-2919-4b09-8289-ade6b4b14fad" facs="#m-1f694b7c-9070-4681-afb5-73329157b61b" label="lyrics-like">stus, allelú¬ ia : (ta¬</l><l xml:id="m-8594d626-ce52-447f-9982-e5d66ca67298" facs="#m-a0fc708a-2bb8-4bdf-87d2-ae7dae46da1f" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-26e959fa-b33e-44cb-9a1c-1bc2d02b76b3" facs="#m-0d22f3c3-a3b2-41cc-9508-c1954a8e48f5" label="lyrics-like">que epu- lé-mur</l><l xml:id="m-2fe62a10-7b51-460d-a544-5331dd9a7f7e" facs="#m-578ab13e-e22b-41cb-a082-9d44eca2c129" label="lyrics-like">á- zy-mis since-ri-tátis et veri-tá- tis,</l><l xml:id="m-62fd6ba1-6c4a-47b8-ab27-d354ef13f303" facs="#m-1a478df2-f800-4fb8-9fcc-6f451d42af4e" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-4608de0d-deb9-4827-900f-12e703fd581b" facs="#m-f795ce81-42ed-4051-b20c-78cefe2ff08f" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-ea972caa-1025-4033-892e-c43a559de238" facs="#m-9685d598-dec1-4b0b-b516-8961c897f638" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-0818b291-e48b-4cab-a594-33ba5756c8af" facs="#m-31bc6518-8b9d-47da-a076-582f62839f16" label="lyrics-like">al-le- lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-850c1c7c-7daa-400d-bfac-b7b8f1bd122c" facs="#m-22b6005d-a765-425a-9962-e533317865d8" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e7c601c-c893-45f1-b3da-21ac1e545c9e" facs="#m-af998aeb-2388-4cff-a0bb-eee03dad509d" label="ambiguous">ia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
